{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead an expedition into the perilous yet rich underground world known as the Depths. Build outposts, gather resources and venture into the farthest reaches of this dark place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/d2a972de763b7604341a3c76a15701a8.poster.avif?t=1767825930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/d2a972de763b7604341a3c76a15701a8.webm?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/d2a972de763b7604341a3c76a15701a8.mp4?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your outpost using various cards drawn every turn. Carefully balance between harvesting food, doing research and gathering wealth to survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your settlement wisely to create powerful synergies between cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investments in technologies can give you an edge against the unforgiving environment: add new powerful cards into your deck and boost your income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rations might be more valuable than gold in these deserted caverns. The bigger the settlement grows, the harder it is to keep it fed and alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/fbce875fe4595bbb41e474f7c16fa64b.poster.avif?t=1767825930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/fbce875fe4595bbb41e474f7c16fa64b.webm?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/fbce875fe4595bbb41e474f7c16fa64b.mp4?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Depths is a perilous and ever-changing realm that hides tons of wealth.  As you descend,  the environment changes. From the rocky and barren <strong>Upper Levels</strong>, through the foggy <strong>Humid Caves</strong> and scorching\u00a0<strong>Magma Caverns,</strong>\u00a0to the deepest <strong>Abyss:</strong> each biome offers new resources and challenges to overcome. But beware\u00a0of the dangers lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start over!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/fc04ee7a398419399df4133c374eb82d.poster.avif?t=1767825930\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/fc04ee7a398419399df4133c374eb82d.webm?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/fc04ee7a398419399df4133c374eb82d.mp4?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fail, it's not time to give up! Prepare for your next expedition: unlock permanent upgrades and build your starting deck to match your strategy. Procedurally generated caves and a vast collection of cards to choose from will affect your playstyle, making each expedition unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous expeditions have failed to conquer the Depths, and yours is no exception. Learn from your mistakes, gather knowledge, discover game-changing combinations, and become stronger. Only the most iron-willed will return in fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/2a76f77bd7e6263377e5e1d172674382.poster.avif?t=1767825930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/2a76f77bd7e6263377e5e1d172674382.webm?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/2a76f77bd7e6263377e5e1d172674382.mp4?t=1767825930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705150?t=1767825930","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/bdfb09c70113b55bc89e7c8bdf303e0e870c68fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767825930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/98d21fd0255b693f13a2057f4d4ab7af5cafca92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767825930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/98d21fd0255b693f13a2057f4d4ab7af5cafca92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767825930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3731740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead an expedition into the perilous yet rich underground world known as the Depths. Build outposts, gather resou